  "analysis_md": "解析：\n\n显然，我们有\n\n$(x+y)\\,dx+(x-y)\\,dy$\n\n$=(y\\,dx+x\\,dy)+(x\\,dx-y\\,dy)$\n\n$=d(xy)+d\\left(\\frac{x^2-y^2}{2}\\right)$\n\n$=d\\left(xy+\\frac{x^2-y^2}{2}\\right)，$\n\n即为全微分方程，得\n\n原式 $=\\int_{(0,1)}^{(2,3)}d\\left(xy+\\frac{x^2-y^2}{2}\\right)$\n\n$=\\left(xy+\\frac{x^2-y^2}{2}\\right)\\bigg|_{(0,1)}^{(2,3)}=4$",
